  "required_input_order": [
    "Authenticate governing context and protected current cancellation/hold state.",
    "Resolve the approved required obligation inventory and exact subject.",
    "Validate reference kinds, versions, measurement scope, provenance, completeness, contradictions and freshness.",
    "Normalize required evaluations; absent results are UNKNOWN, missing criteria PENDING_REVIEW.",
